  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>此資料包將變更以下武器的動作組：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1119033/description_3b828c9a-7821-42d6-bbe5-e8f58850423e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>使用需求：</p>\n<p><strong>Epicfight 與 WeaponsOfMiracles</strong></p>\n<p><strong>可使用 Epicfight 最新版本</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">安裝方式：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">簡便的方法是安裝<strong>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drp-global-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Global</a></strong><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drp-global-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>套件</strong></a>，並將檔案放入資源包中即可遊玩。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">最困難且繁瑣的方式是：在您建立的每個世界中，將檔案放入資料包資料夾，&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">路徑為（你的世界檔案）saves&gt;New world（或您自訂的世界名稱）&gt;datapacks，接著貼上該檔案</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>若您願意瀏覽我的其他作品，我會非常感謝：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>整合包：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-grand-hunt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">The Grand Hunt</span></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">相容套件：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/compat-epic-fight-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>Ice and Fire + Epic Fight 相容套件</strong></span></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/compat-aquamirae-epic-fight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Aquamirae + Epic Fight 相容套件</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/compat-born-in-chaos-epic-fight-1-20-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Born in Chaos + Epic Fight 1-20-1 相容套件</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/compat-cataclysm-epic-fight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Cataclysm + Epic Fight 相容套件</span></a></strong></p>",
